  "notes": "ETYMOLOGY:\n{独|どく} (alone, solo) + {奏|そう} (play music)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {独奏者|どくそうしゃ} - soloist\n- {独奏会|どくそうかい} - solo recital\n- ソロ - solo (loanword)\n- {独唱|どくしょう} - solo singing\n- {合奏|がっそう} - ensemble performance\n- {協奏曲|きょうそうきょく} - concerto (features soloist with orchestra)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ピアノ{独奏|どくそう} - piano solo\n- バイオリン{独奏|どくそう} - violin solo\n- {独奏|どくそう}を{務|つと}める - to serve as soloist\n- {独奏|どくそう}パート - solo part\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {独奏|どくそう} - solo (instrumental)\n- {独唱|どくしょう} - solo (vocal)\n- {合奏|がっそう} - ensemble (multiple performers together)",
